    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f Summary from cooking diaries \ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf73 Hire a new chef if the food is overcooked again</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2615\ufe0f Coffee always comes with free baking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc3 There are never enough waitress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd71 Barista shouldn't be sleepy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PS: These and other rules of the restaurant business, you will only learn by playing Cafe Dash: Cooking, Diner Game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work your way up from a small caf\u00e9 in a shopping mall to a gourmet restaurant empire - a favorite place of entertainment for show business stars!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In our game you will be able to develop your restaurant business, as well as: manage your staff, fulfill your clients' wishes, renew your equipment, and surprise everybody with new dishes from all over the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different boosters to move towards your goal faster and overcome difficult levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >French aesthetics, Italian classics, exclusive fusion or molecular cuisine - how YOUR business story will evolve is for you to decide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And don't forget to pet our cute kitty - because your mood depends on it! And not only yours, but all the visitors of your restaurant empire!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f Summary from cooking diaries \ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf73 Hire a new chef if the food is overcooked again</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2615\ufe0f Coffee always comes with free baking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc3 There are never enough waitress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd71 Barista shouldn't be sleepy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PS: These and other rules of the restaurant business, you will only learn by playing Cafe Dash: Cooking, Diner Game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work your way up from a small caf\u00e9 in a shopping mall to a gourmet restaurant empire - a favorite place of entertainment for show business stars!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In our game you will be able to develop your restaurant business, as well as: manage your staff, fulfill your clients' wishes, renew your equipment, and surprise everybody with new dishes from all over the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different boosters to move towards your goal faster and overcome difficult levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >French aesthetics, Italian classics, exclusive fusion or molecular cuisine - how YOUR business story will evolve is for you to decide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And don't forget to pet our cute kitty - because your mood depends on it! And not only yours, but all the visitors of your restaurant empire!</p>",
    "short_description": "\ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f\ud83c\udf55Your dream restaurants and cafes awaits! \u2764\ufe0f Addictive levels and unique locations \u2708\ufe0f Hours of entertainment in the time-management genre \u23f0",
